Drama Queen guitar chords easy lesson sung by Taylor Swift.

"Drama Queen" is listed in Swift's SONY Registry and was likely excluded from the 2010 album "Speak Now," despite being co-written by Martin Johnson. Johnson was also involved in penning "If This Was a Movie," featured on the deluxe edition of the same album.

According to a fan who meticulously compiles Swift's unreleased tracks, the song's presence in databases dates back to approximately June 2009, suggesting that Swift may have crafted it in 2008 or the early months of 2009.

A brief excerpt of the song surfaced in February 2023.

